# Registry Set With Crypto-Classes From The "Cryptography" PowerShell Namespace | T1027.010, T1059.001, T1547.001 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules-threat-hunting/windows/registry/registry_set/registry_set_powershell_crypto_namespace.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=13 TargetObject="*\\Shell\\Open\\Command*" (Details IN ("*powershell*", "*pwsh*")) Details="*System.Security.Cryptography.*" (Details IN ("*.AesCryptoServiceProvider*", "*.DESCryptoServiceProvider*", "*.DSACryptoServiceProvider*", "*.RC2CryptoServiceProvider*", "*.Rijndael*", "*.RSACryptoServiceProvider*", "*.TripleDESCryptoServiceProvider*"))
